\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Meet and right it is to sing, 
\par In every time and place,
\par Glory to our heavenly King,
\par The God of truth and grace :
\par Join we then with sweet accord, 
\par All in one thanksgiving join;
\par Holy, holy, holy Lord,
\par Eternal praise be Thine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thee the first-born sons of light,
\par In choral symphonies,
\par Praise by day, day without night,
\par And never, never cease;
\par Angels and archangels all
\par Praise the mystic Three in One,
\par Sing, and stop, and gaze, and fall
\par O'erwhelmed before Thy throne.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Vying with that happy choir,
\par Who chant Thy praise above,
\par We on angels' wings aspire,
\par The wings of faith and love :
\par Thee they sing with glory crowned,
\par We extol the slaughtered Lamb;
\par Lower if our voices sound,
\par Our subject is the same.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Father, God, Thy love we praise,
\par Which gave Thy Son to die;
\par Jesus, full of truth and grace,
\par Alike we glorify;
\par Spirit, Comforter divine,
\par Praise by all to Thee be given;
\par Till we in full chorus join,
\par And earth is turned to heaven.     
\par                                   Amen,
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

